                      (        forth.asm):04126         * from the system stack that will contain the 4 bytes (double cell) ultimately
                      (        forth.asm):04127         * holding the result (MSB first, what else?).
                      (        forth.asm):04128         *
                      (        forth.asm):04129         * System stack structure:
                      (        forth.asm):04130         * ,S    Result scratch area (Result MSB)
